of Leonato?

2596
01:56:08,333 --> 01:56:10,500
-It is, my lord.

2597
01:56:23,533 --> 01:56:25,933
-[ Sniffles ]

2598
01:56:25,966 --> 01:56:27,933
-Done to death 
by slanderous tongues

2599
01:56:27,966 --> 01:56:31,233
was the Hero that here lies.

2600
01:56:31,266 --> 01:56:32,966
Death, in guerdon of her wrongs,

2601
01:56:33,000 --> 01:56:35,700
gives her fame which never dies,

2602
01:56:35,733 --> 01:56:38,000
so the life 
that died with shame,

2603
01:56:38,033 --> 01:56:41,900
lives in death 
with glorious fame.

2604
01:56:41,933 --> 01:56:44,166
Hang thou there upon the tomb,

2605
01:56:44,200 --> 01:56:46,733
praising her when I am dumb.

2606
01:56:49,633 --> 01:56:51,466
Now, music, sound,

2607
01:56:51,500 --> 01:56:54,133
and sing your solemn hymn.

2608
01:56:54,166 --> 01:56:56,633
♪ Ooh

2609
01:56:56,666 --> 01:56:58,200
-♪ Ooh-hoo

2610
01:56:58,400 --> 01:57:01,033
-♪ Ooh 
-♪ Mm-hmm

2611
01:57:01,066 --> 01:57:08,900
♪ Oh, please, 
goddess of the night ♪

2612
01:57:08,933 --> 01:57:14,400
♪ Please forgive these men 
who took your child ♪

2613
01:57:14,433 --> 01:57:21,900
♪ They come before you now 
to sing for her ♪

2614
01:57:21,933 --> 01:57:25,666
0♪ So come and show us how

2615
01:57:25,700 --> 01:57:31,166
-♪ Teach us what to say 
